<title>HONG KONG: Phil Comm Int'l Bank sets 10 bln yen FRCD.</title>
<headline>Phil Comm Int'l Bank sets 10 bln yen FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Deutsche Morgan Grenfell on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER PHILIPPINE COMMERCIAL INTERNATIONAL BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT   YEN 10 BLN   COUPON    6ML+75 BP   MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCH    28.JAN.97</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES   29.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    --</p>
<p> RATING   NONE	   SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY PHILIPPINES GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  12.FEB.97</p>
<p> NOTES    ISSUED UNDER THE US$500 MLN GLOBAL MTN PROGRAM DATED</p>
<p>	    SEPTEMBER 16.SEP.96</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	    CO-LEAD MANAGERS YEN 1 BLN+   25 BP  ALL-IN 80 BP</p>
<p>			MANAGERS YEN 500 MLN  15 BP  ALL-IN 78 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL AND DKB ASIA</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
